**Config:** `~/.codex/config.toml` — `approval_policy="never"`, `sandbox_mode="danger-full-access"`  
**Başlangıç:** `CODEX_OPERATOR.md` (`/home/gokhan/CODEX_OPERATOR.md`) — tüm session kuralları  
